[en.IDEA_DAIR_OSB]
Ornithia Shipbuilder

[en.IDEA_DAIR_OSB_desc]
The legendary battle against the Storm King has made Captain Celaeno’s name resound throughout the small town of Maria. More and more ponies are coming to join the pirate group, and the prices of cargo ships and pirate ships are soaring. Seeing the tension of the ships, Celaeno decided to take advantage of the situation and establish a shipyard in Ornithia, selling the same pirate ships and improved series of Captain Seraino to the newcomers of the Sea of Clouds. The sails of the Sea of Clouds are now floating to the world.

[zh.IDEA_DAIR_OSB]
奥尼西亚造船厂

[zh.IDEA_DAIR_OSB_desc]
与风暴大王当年传奇的一役让塞拉伊诺的名号响彻小马利亚，越来越多的慕名前来者想要加入海盗团，货船和海盗船的价格也水涨船高。眼看着船只紧张，塞拉伊诺决定趁势在奥尼西亚建立造船厂，向云海的新手们出售同款塞拉伊诺船长的同款海盗船和改良系列。云海的帆，飘向各地。
